| `GET /api/restaurants/{id}` | `get_restaurant` (main.py:82-116) → `get_optional_user` (main.py:83; auth.py:29-30) → `get_db` (main.py:84) → `restaurant`, `menu_item`, `restaurant_review JOIN user` (main.py:85-99) → müşteriyse `order` ve `restaurant_review` yetenek sorguları (main.py:107-115) → `displayed_rating` ile zenginleştirilmiş restoran (main.py:100-116) |
